$b['The Two Faces'] = 'Two panels side by side on one image, divided down the middle. LEFT PANEL: the tattoo design alone on a plain white background, shown flat exactly as described, no body, drawn large so it fills most of the panel. RIGHT PANEL: Studio photograph of a real person''s body showing the same exact tattoo where described, healed tattoo on real skin in soft even light, the rest of the body modestly covered by simple plain clothing, only the tattooed area bare, plain seamless light grey studio backdrop - no room, no furniture, no scenery. The tattoo in both panels is identical. The tattoo: The Two Faces - a beautiful woman''s face gradually transforming into a terrifying demonic face, both expressions sharing the same anatomy - one half serene with a golden halo and white hair, the other half cracked and dark with a horn and a red glowing eye. A Good vs Evil tattoo in black-and-grey realism with gold and deep red accents. No text, labels, logos or watermarks in the tattoo. In the right panel it is on a woman, outer upper arm, a medium-to-large tattoo that still sits well inside that area, not a full sleeve.'
